    {
      "duration_frames": 120,
      "from_frame": 0,
      "text": "This empty cell should not become a zero."
    },
    {
      "duration_frames": 210,
      "from_frame": 120,
      "text": "While checking our research workflow, we made a tiny test with three invented rows."
    },
    {
      "duration_frames": 210,
      "from_frame": 330,
      "text": "The first has zero saves. The second has no save observation. The third has twelve."
    },
    {
      "duration_frames": 210,
      "from_frame": 540,
      "text": "Those first two rows mean different things: observed zero, and information we do not have."
    },
    {
      "duration_frames": 210,
      "from_frame": 750,
      "text": "Our local check preserves that difference when it calculates the rate. The missing result stays empty."
    },
    {
      "duration_frames": 180,
      "from_frame": 960,
      "text": "This tests one rule. It does not prove the whole report, or explain why a video performed."
    },
    {
      "duration_frames": 180,
      "from_frame": 1140,
      "text": "A person still reviews which rows can be compared and what evidence is missing."
    },
    {
      "duration_frames": 180,
      "from_frame": 1320,
      "text": "Open one report you use. Can you tell a measured zero from an unknown?"
    }
  ],
